      ],
      "entries": [
        "A living creature struck by a graul's jaws attack must succeed at a DC 20 Fortitude save or become paralyzed. It can attempt a new check at the end of each of its turns, and the DC cumulatively decreases by 1 on each such check. A creature paralyzed by this ability is also affected by the graul's darkvision invisibility for as long as the effect persists."
      ],
